@tjffleury37 I love that you asked this! I think it’s about listening to our body’s wisdom and no one can tell us whether thats good or bad. Im’m 52 very active and I am finding that more than 1 meal a day is becoming too much. I fast from 7pm until noon as a way to reset. I have a super nurturing smoothie or a light snack and dinner. Thats it. 

Im going to honor that until my body needs and says something different. 

This is coming from a former bulimic who use to punish her body and did so for 19 years. Much love! Your body knows❤️
